(>> Solution to Question 4:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: If y = arctan\(x\), prove that \(1 + x^2\) * y_{n+2} + 2\(n + 1\) * x * y_{n+1} + n\(n + 1\) * y_n = 0. Hence determine the value of y_n\(0\) for all positive integers n.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: First and second derivatives:) Tj
T*
(   y = arctan\(x\) => y1 = 1 / \(1 + x^2\) => \(1 + x^2\) * y1 = 1.) Tj
T*
(   Differentiate once more:) Tj
T*
(   \(1 + x^2\) * y2 + 2x * y1 = 0.) Tj
T*
(   Step 2: Differentiate n times using Leibniz's Rule:) Tj
T*
(   Apply d^n/dx^n:) Tj
T*
(   Term 1: d^n / dx^n [ \(1 + x^2\) * y2 ]) Tj
T*
(   = C\(n, 0\) * y_{n+2} * \(1 + x^2\) + C\(n, 1\) * y_{n+1} * \(2x\) + C\(n, 2\) * y_n * \(2\)) Tj
T*
(   = \(1 + x^2\) * y_{n+2} + 2n * x * y_{n+1} + n\(n - 1\) * y_n.) Tj
T*
(   Term 2: d^n / dx^n [ 2x * y1 ]) Tj
T*
(   = 2 * [ C\(n, 0\) * y_{n+1} * x + C\(n, 1\) * y_n * 1 ]) Tj
T*
(   = 2x * y_{n+1} + 2n * y_n.) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Combine terms:) Tj
T*
(   \(1 + x^2\) * y_{n+2} + \(2n + 2\) * x * y_{n+1} + [ n\(n - 1\) + 2n ] * y_n = 0) Tj
T*
(   => \(1 + x^2\) * y_{n+2} + 2\(n + 1\) * x * y_{n+1} + n\(n + 1\) * y_n = 0. \(Proved\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 4: Evaluate y_n\(0\):) Tj
T*
(   Set x = 0 in the recurrence relation:) Tj
T*
(   y_{n+2}\(0\) + 0 + n\(n + 1\) * y_n\(0\) = 0) Tj
T*
(   => y_{n+2}\(0\) = -n\(n + 1\) * y_n\(0\).) Tj
T*
(   Initial values at x = 0:) Tj
T*
(   y\(0\) = arctan\(0\) = 0.) Tj
T*
(   y1\(0\) = 1 / \(1 + 0\) = 1.) Tj
T*
(   y2\(0\) = -2\(0\)*y1\(0\) / 1 = 0.) Tj
T*
(   For Even n:) Tj
T*
(   Since y\(0\) = 0 and y2\(0\) = 0, by induction:) Tj
T*
(   y_n\(0\) = 0 for all even positive integers n = 2, 4, 6, ...) Tj
T*
(   For Odd n \(let n = 2k + 1\):) Tj
T*
(   y1\(0\) = 1 = 0!) Tj
T*
(   y3\(0\) = -1\(2\) * y1\(0\) = -2! = \(-1\)^1 * 2!) Tj
T*
(   y5\(0\) = -3\(4\) * y3\(0\) = -12 * \(-2\) = +24 = 4! = \(-1\)^2 * 4!) Tj
T*
(   y7\(0\) = -5\(6\) * y5\(0\) = -30 * 24 = -720 = -6! = \(-1\)^3 * 6!) Tj
T*
(   In general, for odd n:) Tj
T*
(   y_n\(0\) = \(-1\)^\(\(n - 1\)/2\) * \(n - 1\)!.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
