(   - f\(x\) = ln\(1 + x\) => f\(0\) = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - f'\(x\) = \(1 + x\)^-1 => f'\(0\) = 1.) Tj
T*
(   - f''\(x\) = -\(1 + x\)^-2 => f''\(0\) = -1.) Tj
T*
(   - f'''\(x\) = 2!\(1 + x\)^-3 => f'''\(0\) = 2!.) Tj
T*
(   - In general: f^\(n\)\(0\) = \(-1\)^\(n - 1\) * \(n - 1\)!.) Tj
T*
(   - Maclaurin series:) Tj
T*
(   ln\(1 + x\) = x - x^2/2 + x^3/3 - x^4/4 + ... + \(-1\)^\(n - 1\) * \(x^n / n\) + ...) Tj
T*
(   - Interval of Convergence:) Tj
T*
(   Ratio test: lim |a_{n+1} / a_n| = |x| < 1.) Tj
T*
(   At x = 1: 1 - 1/2 + 1/3 - 1/4 + ... \(converges by alternating series test to ln 2\).) Tj
T*
(   At x = -1: -\(1 + 1/2 + 1/3 + ...\) \(diverges, harmonic series\).) Tj
T*
(   Interval of convergence is: -1 < x <= 1.) Tj
