(   - Second derivatives:) Tj
T*
(   x'' = r'' cos theta - 2 r' sin theta - r cos theta) Tj
T*
(   y'' = r'' sin theta + 2 r' cos theta - r sin theta.) Tj
T*
(   - Denominator term x' * y'' - y' * x'':) Tj
T*
(   Multiplying and using trigonometric identities simplifies to:) Tj
T*
(   x' * y'' - y' * x'' = r^2 + 2*\(r'\)^2 - r * r''.) Tj
T*
(   - Hence: rho = [ r^2 + \(r'\)^2 ]^\(3/2\) / |r^2 + 2*\(r'\)^2 - r * r''|. \(Proved\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Radius of Curvature for Cardioid r = a*\(1 + cos theta\):) Tj
T*
(   - r = a*\(1 + cos theta\).) Tj
T*
(   - r' = -a * sin theta.) Tj
T*
(   - r'' = -a * cos theta.) Tj
T*
(   - Compute r^2 + \(r'\)^2:) Tj
T*
(   r^2 + \(r'\)^2 = a^2 * \(1 + cos theta\)^2 + a^2 * sin^2 theta) Tj
T*
(   = a^2 * [ 1 + 2*cos theta + cos^2 theta + sin^2 theta ]) Tj
T*
(   = a^2 * [ 2 + 2*cos theta ] = 2*a^2 * \(1 + cos theta\)) Tj
T*
(   = 4*a^2 * cos^2\(theta / 2\).) Tj
T*
(   Numerator = [ 4*a^2 * cos^2\(theta / 2\) ]^\(3/2\) = 8*a^3 * cos^3\(theta / 2\).) Tj
T*
(   - Compute Denominator: r^2 + 2*\(r'\)^2 - r * r'':) Tj
T*
(   r^2 = a^2 * \(1 + 2*cos theta + cos^2 theta\)) Tj
T*
(   2*\(r'\)^2 = 2*a^2 * sin^2 theta) Tj
T*
(   -r * r'' = - [ a*\(1 + cos theta\) ] * [ -a * cos theta ] = a^2 * \(cos theta + cos^2 theta\)) Tj
T*
(   Sum = a^2 * [ 1 + 2*cos theta + cos^2 theta + 2*sin^2 theta + cos theta + cos^2 theta ]) Tj
T*
(   = a^2 * [ 1 + 3*cos theta + 2*\(cos^2 theta + sin^2 theta\) ]) Tj
T*
(   = a^2 * [ 1 + 3*cos theta + 2 ] = 3*a^2 * \(1 + cos theta\)) Tj
T*
(   = 6*a^2 * cos^2\(theta / 2\).) Tj
T*
(   - Evaluate rho:) Tj
T*
(   rho = [ 8*a^3 * cos^3\(theta / 2\) ] / [ 6*a^2 * cos^2\(theta / 2\) ]) Tj
T*
(   = \(4/3\) * a * cos\(theta / 2\).) Tj
T*
(   - Express in terms of r:) Tj
T*
(   Since r = 2a * cos^2\(theta / 2\) => cos\(theta / 2\) = sqrt\(r / \(2a\)\):) Tj
T*
(   rho = \(4/3\) * a * sqrt\(r / \(2a\)\) = \(2/3\) * sqrt\(2 * a * r\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
