(>> Solution to Question 24:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Apply the curve tracing algorithm to thoroughly analyze and sketch the Cissoid of Diocles: y^2 * \(2a - x\) = x^3 \(where a > 0\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Symmetry:) Tj
T*
(   The equation contains y only to an even power \(y^2\).) Tj
T*
(   Therefore, replacing y by -y leaves the equation unchanged.) Tj
T*
(   The curve is strictly SYMMETRIC about the x-axis.) Tj
T*
(   Step 2: Origin and Tangents at Origin:) Tj
T*
(   f\(0, 0\) = 0, so the curve passes through the origin.) Tj
T*
(   Lowest degree terms: y^2 * 2a = 0 => y^2 = 0 => y = 0 \(double coincident tangent\).) Tj
T*
(   Since both tangents coincide with the x-axis, the origin is a CUSP of the first kind.) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Intercepts:) Tj
T*
(   - Setting y = 0 gives x^3 = 0 => x = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Setting x = 0 gives y = 0.) Tj
T*
(   The origin \(0, 0\) is the ONLY intercept on both axes.) Tj
T*
(   Step 4: Asymptotes:) Tj
T*
(   - Rearrange equation: y^2 * \(2a - x\) - x^3 = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Highest power of y is y^2; its coefficient is \(2a - x\).) Tj
T*
(   - Equate coefficient to zero:) Tj
T*
(   2a - x = 0 => x = 2a.) Tj
T*
(   Thus, x = 2a is a VERTICAL ASYMPTOTE.) Tj
T*
(   - Highest power of x is x^3 \(coefficient -1, constant\). No horizontal asymptote.) Tj
T*
(   Step 5: Region of Existence:) Tj
T*
(   Solve for y:) Tj
T*
(   y = +- x * sqrt\(x / \(2a - x\)\).) Tj
T*
(   - For y to be real, x / \(2a - x\) must be >= 0:) Tj
T*
(   This requires 0 <= x < 2a.) Tj
T*
(   - If x < 0: x is negative and 2a - x > 0, so x/\(2a - x\) < 0 => y is imaginary.) Tj
T*
(   - If x >= 2a: 2a - x <= 0, so x/\(2a - x\) < 0 => y is imaginary.) Tj
T*
(   - Therefore, the ENTIRE curve lies confined in the vertical strip:) Tj
T*
(   0 <= x < 2a.) Tj
T*
(   Step 6: Behavior as x -> 2a:) Tj
T*
(   As x -> 2a-, y -> +- infinity.) Tj
T*
(   The two branches flare outward symmetrically, asymptotic to x = 2a.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
